<div style="background-color: #FAF8F5; padding: 6rem 0;">
  <div class="page-width" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 5%;">
    {% style %}
      .story-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 5rem;
        align-items: center;
      }
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .story-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr !important;
        }
      }
      .story-title {
        font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
        font-size: 3.5rem;
        font-weight: 300;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        line-height: 1.1;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #1a1a1a;
      }
      .story-tagline {
        font-family: var(--font-body-family);
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #555;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        font-weight: 400;
        border-left: 2px solid #D4AF37; /* Gold accent line */
        padding-left: 1.5rem;
      }
      .story-paragraph {
        color: #666;
        line-height: 1.8;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }
      .story-image-container {
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        border-radius: 4px;
        box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      }
      .story-image {
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        display: block;
        transition: transform 1.5s ease;
      }
      .story-image-container:hover .story-image {
        transform: scale(1.03);
      }
    {% endstyle %}
    
    <div class="story-grid">
      <div>
        <h1 class="story-title">About Velour</h1>
        <p class="story-tagline">Crafting modern, minimal silhouettes designed to elevate the everyday life of the contemporary individual.</p>
        <p class="story-paragraph">Velour was founded in 2024 with a singular vision: to create a curated wardrobe that transcends the cycle of fast fashion. Our designs are rooted in architectural lines, quiet luxury, and an unwavering commitment to fine materials.</p>
        <p class="story-paragraph">We believe that true elegance lies in the details. Every thread, every seam, and every fabric selection is meticulously chosen in our studio. We source our textiles responsibly, working only with ethical mills to ensure each piece not only looks beautiful but stands the test of time.</p>
        <p class="story-paragraph">Our aesthetic is quiet yet profound. By focusing on neutral tones, clean cuts, and premium comfort, Velour is designed to become a natural extension of your personal narrative.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="story-image-container">
        <img class="story-image" src="{{ 'about-us-editorial.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Velour Luxury Editorial">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Our Story",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
